sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (edge TLS)
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Ollama as Ollama Sidecar<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as SQLite Database<br/>File I/O
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,K8s: Flow 1: Recommendation Pipeline

    User->>Route: Open Planner UI
    Route->>UI: TLS terminated → HTTP/8501
    User->>Route: Describe requirements (natural language)
    Route->>UI: Forward request
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/extract-intent<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>Ollama: POST /api/generate<br/>HTTP/11434 (Granite 3.3 2B)
    Ollama-->>Backend: Extracted intent JSON
    Backend-->>UI: Intent response
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-specification<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend-->>UI: Deployment specification with SLO targets
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-recommendations<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>DB: Query benchmark data
    DB-->>Backend: Model + GPU benchmark results
    Backend-->>UI: Ranked recommendations<br/>(quality / cost / latency / balanced)
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-deployment<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend-->>UI: KServe/vLLM YAML bundle
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/deploy-bundle-to-cluster<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>K8s: kubectl apply InferenceService<br/>HTTPS/6443 (SA token)
    K8s-->>Backend: Deployment status
    Backend-->>UI: Deployment result

    Note over User,K8s: Flow 2: Capacity Planning with Model Catalog

    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MC as Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    User->>Route: Request model info
    Route->>Backend: POST /api/v1/model-info
    Backend->>HF: GET model config<br/>HTTPS/443 (Bearer HF_TOKEN)
    HF-->>Backend: Model architecture details
    Backend->>MC: GET benchmark data<br/>HTTPS/8443 (Bearer / SA token, service-CA TLS)
    MC-->>Backend: Benchmark results
    Backend-->>User: Capacity analysis

    Note over User,K8s: Flow 3: GPU Detection (Background)

    Backend->>K8s: List nodes<br/>HTTPS/6443 (SA token)
    K8s-->>Backend: Node list with nvidia.com/gpu.product labels
    Note over Backend: Cache GPU types for 300s TTL
